WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.026
Use this checkpoint to test whether you understand
the reasoning not only the SQL Explain

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:12.675
why NULL differs from blank text Explain why an
invalid value should

00:00:12.701 --> 00:00:18.290
be detected before it is corrected Explain why
duplicate detection

00:00:18.316 --> 00:00:24.600
and survivor selection are separate Explain the
limits of regex validation

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:29.689
And explain why a transaction makes cleaning updates
safer
